{"video_id": "Ah_uuTwGOYU", "source": "api", "language": "en", "segments": [{"text": "Who would win in a race?\nThe fastest man in the world", "start": 0.1, "duration": 2.803}, {"text": "or the fastest robot in the world?", "start": 2.97, "duration": 2.002}, {"text": "Go!", "start": 6.974, "duration": 0.667}, {"text": "We are testing the most advanced robots\never made against the most elite humans.", "start": 7.708, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "Like the world's best driver\nagainst an AI robot", "start": 13.614, "duration": 3.637}, {"text": "who can push a race car\npast the laws of physics,", "start": 17.317, "duration": 3.27}, {"text": "or the best human athletes against robots\nwho literally could replace them,", "start": 20.654, "duration": 4.905}, {"text": "and so much more.", "start": 25.626, "duration": 1.134}, {"text": "All to find out: Are the days\nof the human species numbered?", "start": 26.827, "duration": 4.004}, {"text": "The answer may surprise you.", "start": 30.898, "duration": 1.701}, {"text": "All starting with the strongest man\nin the world vs. this mech.", "start": 32.666, "duration": 4.872}, {"text": "That's massive.", "start": 39.373, "duration": 1.401}, {"text": "This robot is 50 times stronger\nthan any human could ever dream of being,", "start": 40.841, "duration": 5.238}, {"text": "leaving us\nand the fate of humanity,", "start": 46.146, "duration": 2.536}, {"text": "all in the willpower\nof this one man.", "start": 48.749, "duration": 2.969}, {"text": "He is gonna be going head to head\nagainst this giant robot mech.", "start": 51.785, "duration": 4.104}, {"text": "Oh! That is terrifying.", "start": 55.956, "duration": 1.902}, {"text": "The challenge is simple.", "start": 57.925, "duration": 1.268}, {"text": "You’ll have to flip these 3 cars\nand pull that bus off those other cars", "start": 59.259, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "before this mech does.", "start": 64.364, "duration": 1.435}, {"text": "If not, humanity is off to a bad start\nin this video.", "start": 66.433, "duration": 2.803}, {"text": "I have to win.", "start": 69.303, "duration": 0.734}, {"text": "And us humans need you to.", "start": 70.103, "duration": 1.435}, {"text": "3, 2, 1…", "start": 71.605, "duration": 2.736}, {"text": "Go!", "start": 75.175, "duration": 1.035}, {"text": "[grunting]", "start": 76.276, "duration": 0.601}, {"text": "[grunting]", "start": 78.745, "duration": 0.668}, {"text": "Oh my gosh!\nYou already flipped the car!", "start": 79.479, "duration": 2.67}, {"text": "But here comes the mech!", "start": 82.216, "duration": 1.134}, {"text": "The mech flipped the first car!", "start": 83.417, "duration": 1.401}, {"text": "Thor is onto the second car.", "start": 84.885, "duration": 1.468}, {"text": "Come on! [grunting]", "start": 86.42, "duration": 2.469}, {"text": "Wait, oh my gosh!", "start": 88.956, "duration": 1.101}, {"text": "Come on!", "start": 90.123, "duration": 1.035}, {"text": "Oh, no! The robot's catching up.", "start": 91.225, "duration": 1.801}, {"text": "The second car's been flipped!", "start": 93.16, "duration": 1.334}, {"text": "For humanity!", "start": 94.561, "duration": 1.802}, {"text": "Bro what are you doing?\nFlip the car.", "start": 96.43, "duration": 1.835}, {"text": "[grunting]", "start": 98.332, "duration": 0.734}, {"text": "Oh! Oh, he's struggling.", "start": 99.132, "duration": 1.802}, {"text": "[grunting]", "start": 101.001, "duration": 1.301}, {"text": "Oh!", "start": 102.369, "duration": 0.968}, {"text": "He's flipped all the cars.", "start": 103.704, "duration": 1.268}, {"text": "Now, the hardest part.", "start": 105.038, "duration": 1.101}, {"text": "Does he get the bus first pull?", "start": 106.206, "duration": 1.502}, {"text": "Ah! [grunting]", "start": 107.774, "duration": 1.902}, {"text": "He’s slipping!", "start": 109.743, "duration": 0.834}, {"text": "For humanity!", "start": 110.644, "duration": 0.968}, {"text": "Oh, he's rocking it.", "start": 112.246, "duration": 1.034}, {"text": "Oh Thor, it’s catching up.", "start": 113.547, "duration": 1.368}, {"text": "The robot's about to flip its last car.", "start": 115.048, "duration": 1.802}, {"text": "Oh, he just flipped the third car!", "start": 116.917, "duration": 1.234}, {"text": "It’s a tied game!", "start": 118.352, "duration": 0.967}, {"text": "When the robot gets to those tires,\nit's game over.", "start": 119.386, "duration": 1.902}, {"text": "This mech’s probably\ngonna pull it down first try.", "start": 121.355, "duration": 2.335}, {"text": "So I wouldn't let humanity\ndown here, Thor.", "start": 123.757, "duration": 2.136}, {"text": "We’re all countin’ on ya.", "start": 125.959, "duration": 1.001}, {"text": "The robot's not gonna struggle\nwith this rope.", "start": 127.027, "duration": 1.702}, {"text": "It’s latching onto the tires.", "start": 128.795, "duration": 1.535}, {"text": "It's latched on.\nThe robot’s about to win!", "start": 130.397, "duration": 1.535}, {"text": "Oh, no. This is probably\nyour last pull, Thor.", "start": 131.999, "duration": 2.602}, {"text": "Give it everything you got.", "start": 134.668, "duration": 1.168}, {"text": "[grunting] Come on!", "start": 135.903, "duration": 1.701}, {"text": "[groans]", "start": 137.671, "duration": 1.368}, {"text": "[Jimmy] Oh!", "start": 142.809, "duration": 0.735}, {"text": "You did it!", "start": 145.879, "duration": 1.001}, {"text": "For humanity!", "start": 146.947, "duration": 1.868}, {"text": "On behalf of all the humans,\nhere is a gold medal.", "start": 148.882, "duration": 3.57}, {"text": "Thank you.", "start": 152.519, "duration": 0.701}, {"text": "[Tareq] Let’s go!", "start": 153.287, "duration": 0.6}, {"text": "Humans one, robots zero.", "start": 153.954, "duration": 1.635}, {"text": "Meaning for now,\nhumans are not obsolete.", "start": 155.656, "duration": 2.435}, {"text": "But we still have 6 more clashes", "start": 158.158, "duration": 1.602}, {"text": "to find out if robots will rise\nabove us in the end.", "start": 159.826, "duration": 3.104}, {"text": "So let's head to this next showdown", "start": 162.996, "duration": 1.735}, {"text": "featuring the fastest pitching robot\non the planet.", "start": 164.798, "duration": 3.17}, {"text": "You.", "start": 169.67, "duration": 0.534}, {"text": "Oh, yeah.", "start": 170.27, "duration": 1.235}, {"text": "That is creepy.", "start": 171.572, "duration": 0.867}, {"text": "I get that a lot.", "start": 172.506, "duration": 0.934}, {"text": "Neo is a humanoid robot", "start": 173.507, "duration": 1.601}, {"text": "who imitates the actions\nof its human controller,", "start": 175.175, "duration": 2.803}, {"text": "but not too far\ninto the near future,", "start": 178.045, "duration": 2.135}, {"text": "this android will be capable\nof complete self operation.", "start": 180.247, "duration": 3.503}, {"text": "And this robot is going to be\ngoing against", "start": 183.817, "duration": 2.002}, {"text": "former Giants player Eric Sim!", "start": 185.886, "duration": 2.369}, {"text": "Let's do it.", "start": 188.322, "duration": 0.734}, {"text": "You don't have a chance, my man.", "start": 189.122, "duration": 1.702}, {"text": "Imma take you down.", "start": 190.891, "duration": 0.867}, {"text": "I'll believe it when I see it.", "start": 191.825, "duration": 1.301}, {"text": "Did he just do a mic drop\non me just now?", "start": 194.761, "duration": 1.869}, {"text": "Would you believe me\nif I told you", "start": 196.697, "duration": 1.668}, {"text": "he can pitch a 150 miles an hour?", "start": 198.432, "duration": 1.968}, {"text": "150?! That's fast.", "start": 200.634, "duration": 2.069}, {"text": "For context, the fastest Eric could have\never been pitched to by a human", "start": 202.769, "duration": 3.938}, {"text": "would only be the record holding\n105 miles an hour.", "start": 206.773, "duration": 3.37}, {"text": "So in order to hit 150,\nNeo brought his very own cannon…", "start": 210.21, "duration": 4.672}, {"text": "[laughing]", "start": 214.948, "duration": 0.834}, {"text": "to launch the ball.", "start": 215.849, "duration": 1.035}, {"text": "Neo is gonna be manning this cannon,", "start": 216.95, "duration": 2.102}, {"text": "or I guess robotting this cannon.\nI don't know.", "start": 219.72, "duration": 2.169}, {"text": "This is throwing off everything I know\nas a human.", "start": 221.955, "duration": 1.869}, {"text": "Eric, if you can hit a home run off of\n1 of the 10 pitches neo fires your way,", "start": 223.891, "duration": 5.171}, {"text": "then you'll give the humans a 2-0 lead.", "start": 229.129, "duration": 2.403}, {"text": "Let’s go baby, for humans.", "start": 231.598, "duration": 1.268}, {"text": "[Jimmy] Alright, let's do this.", "start": 232.933, "duration": 1.235}, {"text": "Humanity is counting on you, Eric.", "start": 234.234, "duration": 2.269}, {"text": "I'm ready.", "start": 236.57, "duration": 0.834}, {"text": "Do it for mankind.", "start": 237.471, "duration": 0.901}, {"text": "And to all you baseball players out there,\nyou better hope Eric wins.", "start": 238.438, "duration": 3.971}, {"text": "Because if not,\nyour hope of ever going pro", "start": 242.476, "duration": 3.203}, {"text": "could be brutalized by this machine.", "start": 245.746, "duration": 2.502}, {"text": "[Eric] Oh, my!", "start": 251.151, "duration": 0.667}, {"text": "Ooh!", "start": 251.885, "duration": 0.768}, {"text": "Was that the fastest pitch\nyou've ever seen?", "start": 252.719, "duration": 2.036}, {"text": "Yes, by a long shot.", "start": 255.088, "duration": 1.735}, {"text": "What is that?", "start": 257.257, "duration": 0.868}, {"text": "Ha-ha-ha!", "start": 258.192, "duration": 0.6}, {"text": "Well, here come 9 more,\nso good luck!", "start": 258.859, "duration": 2.069}, {"text": "On you, Neo!", "start": 260.994, "duration": 1.035}, {"text": "[Tareq] Oh my God,\nhere we go.", "start": 262.095, "duration": 1.068}, {"text": "I can't hit that.", "start": 268.769, "duration": 0.934}, {"text": "[Tareq] Dude, he's like mocking you.", "start": 269.77, "duration": 1.368}, {"text": "Alright, let it rip.", "start": 271.205, "duration": 1.001}, {"text": "Ooh!", "start": 275.876, "duration": 1.234}, {"text": "Why is it so fast?", "start": 277.177, "duration": 1.301}, {"text": "Seven more to go.", "start": 278.545, "duration": 0.834}, {"text": "[Tareq] Here it comes.", "start": 279.58, "duration": 1.134}, {"text": "Oh! That's gas.", "start": 281.281, "duration": 1.402}, {"text": "Yo, is Neo celebrating over there?", "start": 282.749, "duration": 1.535}, {"text": "Robots are gonna win.", "start": 284.351, "duration": 1.468}, {"text": "Yo, he hit a Fortnite emote on him.", "start": 285.886, "duration": 1.868}, {"text": "I don't like Neo, I hate him.", "start": 287.988, "duration": 1.268}, {"text": "You're trash.", "start": 289.323, "duration": 0.967}, {"text": "Stop doing the emote on me.", "start": 290.39, "duration": 1.435}, {"text": "Bro, I can feel the wind off of it.", "start": 293.36, "duration": 1.902}, {"text": "It's getting nastier every time.", "start": 295.329, "duration": 1.601}, {"text": "[Jimmy] Oh!", "start": 298.599, "duration": 0.5}, {"text": "He almost hit Neo.", "start": 299.099, "duration": 1.101}, {"text": "Eric, you hit the ball.", "start": 300.267, "duration": 1.034}, {"text": "But remember,\nyou need a home run to win.", "start": 301.368, "duration": 2.169}, {"text": "I got this.", "start": 303.604, "duration": 1.067}, {"text": "Neo you're going down, Machine!", "start": 304.738, "duration": 1.602}, {"text": "Try and hit this, clown.", "start": 306.406, "duration": 1.268}, {"text": "Humans are not obsolete.", "start": 307.741, "duration": 1.268}, {"text": "Do it for mankind.", "start": 309.076, "duration": 0.901}, {"text": "[Jimmy] Eric, you have 4 pitches left.", "start": 310.177, "duration": 1.668}, {"text": "Do you think you got this?", "start": 311.912, "duration": 1.201}, {"text": "You gotta believe for humans.", "start": 313.18, "duration": 1.335}, {"text": "Believe!", "start": 314.581, "duration": 0.935}, {"text": "-Oh, there it is!\n-There it goes!", "start": 322.623, "duration": 0.934}, {"text": "Oh no.", "start": 323.79, "duration": 0.568}, {"text": "Get out! Get out! Get out!", "start": 324.625, "duration": 2.235}, {"text": "-Yeah!\n-[Jimmy] Let's go!", "start": 328.662, "duration": 0.934}, {"text": "I don't like humans.", "start": 330.197, "duration": 0.834}, {"text": "[Eric] Let's go!", "start": 331.098, "duration": 1.034}, {"text": "He did it! 150 miles an hour.", "start": 332.199, "duration": 2.536}, {"text": "Making this the first home run\nmankind has ever hit at a speed so high.", "start": 334.801, "duration": 4.638}, {"text": "Neo, can you crown the human\nwith this $10,000 golden medal?", "start": 339.673, "duration": 3.604}, {"text": "No no no, you didn't win.", "start": 343.343, "duration": 1.168}, {"text": "This is the worst moment of my life.", "start": 344.845, "duration": 1.935}, {"text": "[laughing]", "start": 346.847, "duration": 0.934}, {"text": "Bro you literally made the robot rage quit\nbut that's another point for humanity.", "start": 347.848, "duration": 3.704}, {"text": "Giving the humans a 2-0 lead.", "start": 351.618, "duration": 2.369}, {"text": "So let's see if the robots\ncan kick their way back into this.", "start": 354.054, "duration": 3.203}, {"text": "Because we brought out Adam,", "start": 357.324, "duration": 1.301}, {"text": "who is one of the most insanely accurate\nfootball kickers in the entire world.", "start": 358.692, "duration": 5.339}, {"text": "Going up against\nthe most powerful football kicking robot.", "start": 364.097, "duration": 3.771}, {"text": "I was going to see\nwho can kick further,", "start": 367.935, "duration": 1.568}, {"text": "you or the robot, but…", "start": 369.57, "duration": 1.701}, {"text": "Kick it!", "start": 371.505, "duration": 0.867}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 378.378, "duration": 0.5}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 378.912, "duration": 0.501}, {"text": "So instead,\nwe're gonna do an accuracy challenge.", "start": 379.479, "duration": 3.037}, {"text": "And the rules couldn't be simpler.", "start": 382.583, "duration": 2.135}, {"text": "First one to kick the ball\nand hit the target wins.", "start": 384.785, "duration": 2.736}, {"text": "Adam, do it for humanity.", "start": 387.588, "duration": 1.635}, {"text": "[Jimmy] Alright, let's see it!\nFor humanity.", "start": 389.289, "duration": 2.236}, {"text": "[Jimmy] You didn’t even make it\nin the field goal. Oh boy.", "start": 395.429, "duration": 2.369}, {"text": "We're not off to a good start here.", "start": 397.865, "duration": 1.267}, {"text": "That's awkward. It’s fine.", "start": 399.199, "duration": 1.402}, {"text": "We know this robot can kick far,", "start": 400.667, "duration": 1.969}, {"text": "but can it kick more accurately\nthan a human?", "start": 402.703, "duration": 2.369}, {"text": "Oh.", "start": 405.172, "duration": 1.001}, {"text": "-[Tareq] That was so close!\n-[Karl] That was close.", "start": 406.24, "duration": 1.201}, {"text": "[Jimmy] Humanity lives to see another day.\nAny last words?", "start": 407.508, "duration": 3.136}, {"text": "None.", "start": 410.711, "duration": 0.6}, {"text": "Is that it?", "start": 412.98, "duration": 0.834}, {"text": "[Jimmy] Oh…", "start": 414.915, "duration": 1.034}, {"text": "Adam, have you ever thought about\nnot missing?", "start": 416.183, "duration": 2.269}, {"text": "Everybody misses.", "start": 418.519, "duration": 0.8}, {"text": "[Jimmy] Oh! Whoa, whoa, whoa.", "start": 420.554, "duration": 1.935}, {"text": "Whenever you're ready, Adam.\nThis might be your last chance.", "start": 422.856, "duration": 2.736}, {"text": "-You think?\n-I really do think it is.", "start": 425.659, "duration": 1.702}, {"text": "[Adam] Let's actually put it\nbetween the posts, huh?", "start": 427.427, "duration": 1.502}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 429.029, "duration": 0.734}, {"text": "[Jimmy] That's, uh…", "start": 431.198, "duration": 1.001}, {"text": "[Adam] Dude.", "start": 432.666, "duration": 0.534}, {"text": "Adam, you might be causing the downfall\nof the human race right now.", "start": 433.267, "duration": 2.869}, {"text": "It's not looking so hot\nfor Adam, bruh.", "start": 436.203, "duration": 1.268}, {"text": "3, 2, 1…", "start": 437.538, "duration": 2.535}, {"text": "Fire!", "start": 440.44, "duration": 0.735}, {"text": "[Jimmy] Oh!", "start": 444.778, "duration": 0.901}, {"text": "Wow.", "start": 449.483, "duration": 0.767}, {"text": "Oh, that's tough, man.", "start": 450.317, "duration": 1.401}, {"text": "Team Robots just scored a point.", "start": 451.818, "duration": 1.969}, {"text": "Any last words you want to say\nto that robot?", "start": 453.854, "duration": 1.868}, {"text": "No, it's not gonna say anything back.", "start": 455.789, "duration": 1.835}, {"text": "Well, this next robot can't talk either.", "start": 458.525, "duration": 1.969}, {"text": "But we did get one\nthat can play basketball,", "start": 460.561, "duration": 2.102}, {"text": "because up next,\nwe have 4 time NBA champion Manu Ginóbili", "start": 462.729, "duration": 4.205}, {"text": "going up against the most elite\nbasketball robot in the world.", "start": 467.0, "duration": 4.004}, {"text": "Are you nervous?", "start": 471.305, "duration": 0.834}, {"text": "Very. Intimidating.", "start": 472.372, "duration": 1.035}, {"text": "Whoever gets 2 basketball shots first\nwill win this challenge.", "start": 473.574, "duration": 3.069}, {"text": "Oh yeah. And the second hoop is covered\nin razor sharp nails.", "start": 476.71, "duration": 3.637}, {"text": "Alright. Let's do it. Ok.\nFor humanity.", "start": 480.414, "duration": 1.601}, {"text": "Come on, my old friend.\nHelp me out here.", "start": 482.082, "duration": 2.402}, {"text": "Let's see it.", "start": 485.118, "duration": 0.835}, {"text": "There you go.", "start": 486.053, "duration": 0.867}, {"text": "-That's it. Let's go.\n-Yes. Yes!", "start": 486.987, "duration": 1.602}, {"text": "Let's go.", "start": 488.655, "duration": 0.768}, {"text": "Let's see if the robot\ncan make the shot, too.", "start": 489.489, "duration": 2.103}, {"text": "That big hand…", "start": 491.658, "duration": 1.035}, {"text": "Boo!", "start": 492.759, "duration": 0.601}, {"text": "is so intimidating.", "start": 493.427, "duration": 1.301}, {"text": "Boo!", "start": 494.795, "duration": 1.034}, {"text": "Here we go.", "start": 495.929, "duration": 0.5}, {"text": "[Tareq] There it is. Whoa…", "start": 497.364, "duration": 2.269}, {"text": "[Majd] That is nothing but net.", "start": 500.033, "duration": 1.235}, {"text": "This thing's a monster.", "start": 501.335, "duration": 1.668}, {"text": "While Manu defends humanity\nagainst the machines,", "start": 503.37, "duration": 2.736}, {"text": "I wanna tell you\nabout our new Beast Lab's Hybrids.", "start": 506.173, "duration": 2.769}, {"text": "You can create literally millions\nof variations by mixing and matching.", "start": 509.009, "duration": 4.338}, {"text": "You should give up, man.", "start": 513.413, "duration": 0.968}, {"text": "You hear that?", "start": 514.448, "duration": 1.001}, {"text": "Alright, here we go.", "start": 515.716, "duration": 1.201}, {"text": "Got this.", "start": 517.017, "duration": 0.667}, {"text": "Oh!", "start": 520.354, "duration": 0.734}, {"text": "No!", "start": 521.154, "duration": 0.668}, {"text": "It felt so good.", "start": 521.889, "duration": 1.201}, {"text": "Manu just missed that shot.", "start": 523.223, "duration": 1.502}, {"text": "But make sure you don't miss\npicking up MrBeast Lab Hybrids.", "start": 524.791, "duration": 3.137}, {"text": "Every pack has different rarities,", "start": 527.995, "duration": 1.167}, {"text": "like this hyper chrome\nlimited edition Panther.", "start": 529.229, "duration": 2.436}, {"text": "So go and try to collect them.", "start": 531.732, "duration": 1.067}, {"text": "[Manu] If he makes this one,\nhe deserves the win man.", "start": 532.866, "duration": 2.503}, {"text": "[grunting] Miss it. Miss it!", "start": 535.435, "duration": 2.002}, {"text": "[Tareq] Oh my gosh.", "start": 538.939, "duration": 1.034}, {"text": "Oh.", "start": 540.04, "duration": 0.701}, {"text": "A miss! Let’s go!", "start": 540.807, "duration": 1.435}, {"text": "If you want to create your own\nMrBeast Lab Hybrid,", "start": 542.309, "duration": 2.035}, {"text": "go to any one of these retailers\nright here.", "start": 544.411, "duration": 1.735}, {"text": "Manu, for the love of God,\nhit this shot!", "start": 546.213, "duration": 2.169}, {"text": "You hear that?", "start": 548.448, "duration": 0.5}, {"text": "Alright. Here we go again.", "start": 548.982, "duration": 0.701}, {"text": "You got this.", "start": 549.75, "duration": 0.6}, {"text": "Oh, that's--\nThat looks good. Oh!", "start": 552.252, "duration": 1.602}, {"text": "[groaning]", "start": 553.921, "duration": 0.7}, {"text": "Give me one try.", "start": 554.688, "duration": 1.902}, {"text": "Here we go.", "start": 558.192, "duration": 0.5}, {"text": "If he makes the shot,\nyou officially lose.", "start": 559.626, "duration": 2.403}, {"text": "-[Majd] Miss!\n-[Tareq] Oh, no.", "start": 562.963, "duration": 1.034}, {"text": "The robot just won.", "start": 566.466, "duration": 1.102}, {"text": "[groaning]", "start": 567.634, "duration": 0.834}, {"text": "The robots are officially tied\nwith humans.", "start": 568.535, "duration": 1.969}, {"text": "I'm sorry, Manu.", "start": 570.571, "duration": 0.7}, {"text": "Good job, man.", "start": 571.338, "duration": 0.601}, {"text": "Now that this series is all tied up,", "start": 572.806, "duration": 1.835}, {"text": "let's see which species\nwill drive their way back to a lead.", "start": 574.708, "duration": 3.003}, {"text": "This next challenge\nis personally my favorite.", "start": 577.778, "duration": 2.335}, {"text": "I got one of the fastest drivers\non the planet,", "start": 580.18, "duration": 2.469}, {"text": "and he'll be going up against a car\nliterally driven by a robot.", "start": 582.716, "duration": 3.704}, {"text": "But the robot isn't in the driver's seat.", "start": 586.486, "duration": 2.37}, {"text": "It's back here.\nThis is the AI brain of the car,", "start": 588.922, "duration": 3.103}, {"text": "which in a race can react faster\nthan any human alive,", "start": 592.092, "duration": 3.37}, {"text": "making it the fastest unmanned car\non the planet.", "start": 595.529, "duration": 3.337}, {"text": "I've never seen anything like this before.", "start": 598.932, "duration": 1.535}, {"text": "Both George and the AI\nwill be racing in the same model Mercedes.", "start": 600.534, "duration": 4.304}, {"text": "Let's do it.", "start": 604.905, "duration": 0.5}, {"text": "Here we go!", "start": 605.405, "duration": 0.601}, {"text": "The AI car is up first.", "start": 606.073, "duration": 1.735}, {"text": "3, 2, 1…", "start": 607.875, "duration": 2.836}, {"text": "Go!", "start": 611.378, "duration": 0.734}, {"text": "[Tareq] Oh, it’s zoomin’!", "start": 615.249, "duration": 1.234}, {"text": "[Nolan] I can't believe nobody's\nin that thing!", "start": 616.95, "duration": 1.735}, {"text": "There you go.\n‘Round the first turn-- Good.", "start": 620.687, "duration": 1.168}, {"text": "Second turn-- Good.", "start": 622.155, "duration": 1.168}, {"text": "[Jimmy] Whoa! Oh, that precision.", "start": 624.992, "duration": 2.035}, {"text": "I was not expecting this.", "start": 627.094, "duration": 1.368}, {"text": "So far, it's been a minute and one second.", "start": 628.829, "duration": 1.935}, {"text": "Look how fast it's hittin’ these turns.", "start": 630.831, "duration": 1.802}, {"text": "[George] I reckon, is it, 140 now?", "start": 632.699, "duration": 1.502}, {"text": "Anything around 2 minutes is\nlike a really good lap time on this track.", "start": 634.268, "duration": 3.069}, {"text": "Will it get sub-two minutes?", "start": 637.404, "duration": 1.468}, {"text": "Here it comes.", "start": 638.939, "duration": 0.867}, {"text": "Boom!", "start": 640.14, "duration": 0.467}, {"text": "The AI car has finished its lap.", "start": 640.607, "duration": 2.336}, {"text": "What is it?", "start": 643.01, "duration": 0.767}, {"text": "2:01!", "start": 643.844, "duration": 0.667}, {"text": "Two minutes and one second\nis the time to beat.", "start": 644.578, "duration": 2.469}, {"text": "This is your car.\nThe same exact model as the AI drove.", "start": 647.114, "duration": 3.303}, {"text": "It looks fast. Let's get in.", "start": 650.484, "duration": 1.201}, {"text": "Remember, George, the fate of humanity\ncould rest on this race.", "start": 651.752, "duration": 3.97}, {"text": "Alright, get ready for this, man.", "start": 655.789, "duration": 1.201}, {"text": "3, 2, 1…", "start": 657.291, "duration": 3.27}, {"text": "Go!", "start": 661.161, "duration": 0.801}, {"text": "Who is better?\nMan versus robot!", "start": 663.931, "duration": 2.202}, {"text": "Let's go!", "start": 666.3, "duration": 1.034}, {"text": "Go!", "start": 667.467, "duration": 0.668}, {"text": "Go, George Russell!", "start": 668.202, "duration": 1.301}, {"text": "[Tareq] Around the corner flawlessly!", "start": 669.57, "duration": 1.534}, {"text": "[Jimmy] Holy crap!", "start": 671.171, "duration": 0.968}, {"text": "Oh!", "start": 672.206, "duration": 1.001}, {"text": "I was driftin’ there.", "start": 673.273, "duration": 1.368}, {"text": "[Jimmy] Oh, you can hear it roaring.", "start": 674.942, "duration": 1.835}, {"text": "Oh, we're going in deep.\nWe’re almost in gravel.", "start": 676.844, "duration": 1.835}, {"text": "At this point,\nI was getting pretty scared.", "start": 678.745, "duration": 2.536}, {"text": "Oh my gosh, you're going 220km an hour.", "start": 681.348, "duration": 3.103}, {"text": "Let's show the AI who's boss!\nHumans aren't obsolete yet!", "start": 684.518, "duration": 3.47}, {"text": "Not under my watch.", "start": 688.055, "duration": 1.067}, {"text": "George Russell, you can do it!", "start": 689.189, "duration": 1.802}, {"text": "Oh, I hear a lot of screeching.", "start": 692.759, "duration": 1.235}, {"text": "Is that bad?", "start": 694.061, "duration": 0.734}, {"text": "That's not what we need.\nIt is ok.", "start": 694.862, "duration": 2.869}, {"text": "You're currently 2 seconds behind where\nthe AI car was at this point in the race.", "start": 697.798, "duration": 3.87}, {"text": "[Jimmy] This is crazy.", "start": 701.735, "duration": 1.168}, {"text": "[George] That was a bad corner.", "start": 702.97, "duration": 1.001}, {"text": "Ah, come on…", "start": 704.037, "duration": 1.235}, {"text": "Do it for humanity!", "start": 705.339, "duration": 1.301}, {"text": "You can recover. You got this.", "start": 706.707, "duration": 1.468}, {"text": "Ten seconds!", "start": 708.242, "duration": 0.967}, {"text": "Come on!", "start": 709.276, "duration": 0.534}, {"text": "[Tareq] You got this, George!", "start": 709.877, "duration": 1.067}, {"text": "[Jimmy] You’re catching up!", "start": 711.011, "duration": 1.702}, {"text": "Oh, you did it!", "start": 715.482, "duration": 1.301}, {"text": "-You did it!\n-Come on!", "start": 716.85, "duration": 1.035}, {"text": "Oh my gosh.", "start": 717.951, "duration": 0.634}, {"text": "Woo!", "start": 718.652, "duration": 0.667}, {"text": "-Oh 1:57! He beat it!\n-He beat the robot!", "start": 719.386, "duration": 2.002}, {"text": "Congratulations.\nYou have beaten the AI.", "start": 721.455, "duration": 2.469}, {"text": "-Thank you.\n-You did it for humanity.", "start": 723.991, "duration": 1.701}, {"text": "Let's see if the humans\nwin the next one.", "start": 725.759, "duration": 1.835}, {"text": "Because if we do,\nthen the humans will win this series.", "start": 727.661, "duration": 3.136}, {"text": "But if the robots win,", "start": 730.864, "duration": 1.201}, {"text": "then everything comes down\nto our final race with Noah Lyles. So…", "start": 732.132, "duration": 3.604}, {"text": "For this challenge,\nwe have Grant Horvath.", "start": 735.802, "duration": 2.036}, {"text": "Who is basically the golden boy\nfor YouTube golf", "start": 737.905, "duration": 2.936}, {"text": "vs. Robo-T,\nthe most precise golf robot in the world.", "start": 740.908, "duration": 4.337}, {"text": "You're going down, pretty-boy.", "start": 745.312, "duration": 1.768}, {"text": "I don't like that it talks.", "start": 747.281, "duration": 1.334}, {"text": "On this course are 5 targets\nincreasing in distance.", "start": 748.682, "duration": 3.67}, {"text": "The first player to hit 3 targets\nwins a point for their team.", "start": 752.419, "duration": 3.537}, {"text": "You really think you can beat", "start": 756.023, "duration": 0.901}, {"text": "the most precise golfing robot\nin the world?", "start": 756.99, "duration": 1.702}, {"text": "I don't know.\nIt's gonna be really tricky.", "start": 759.059, "duration": 1.869}, {"text": "There is no competition.", "start": 760.994, "duration": 1.068}, {"text": "We're gonna send Grant\nback to the frat house.", "start": 762.129, "duration": 2.269}, {"text": "[laughing]", "start": 764.464, "duration": 0.601}, {"text": "Oh, wow. Alright.", "start": 765.132, "duration": 1.268}, {"text": "Wow, it’s getting personal up in here.", "start": 766.466, "duration": 1.869}, {"text": "Alright, first shot, baby.", "start": 768.402, "duration": 1.101}, {"text": "Here we go, Chandler.", "start": 769.57, "duration": 0.967}, {"text": "[Chandler] Oh!", "start": 774.575, "duration": 0.9}, {"text": "Oh, yeah!", "start": 777.644, "duration": 2.169}, {"text": "Bro, you did it!", "start": 779.88, "duration": 0.968}, {"text": "[laughing] Let’s go!\nWho would’ve known?", "start": 780.914, "duration": 2.202}, {"text": "Let's go!", "start": 783.183, "duration": 1.435}, {"text": "Robot. Your turn.", "start": 784.685, "duration": 0.901}, {"text": "[Robo-T] Set it up, Majd.\nIt's over.", "start": 785.886, "duration": 2.002}, {"text": "I build up the humans’ confidence\njust to tear it down.", "start": 787.955, "duration": 3.436}, {"text": "Watch this, Grant.", "start": 791.458, "duration": 1.435}, {"text": "[Majd] Aw, that looks like butter.", "start": 794.494, "duration": 1.335}, {"text": "[Grant] Oh, no!", "start": 796.964, "duration": 1.768}, {"text": "That right there is a point.", "start": 799.7, "duration": 1.835}, {"text": "Oh wow, dude.", "start": 801.702, "duration": 1.768}, {"text": "One to one.", "start": 803.537, "duration": 0.6}, {"text": "One point for the robot.", "start": 804.204, "duration": 1.201}, {"text": "It’s all over, pretty-boy.", "start": 805.472, "duration": 2.236}, {"text": "What's your new strategy?", "start": 809.176, "duration": 1.001}, {"text": "Well, we're going to the 150.", "start": 810.244, "duration": 1.268}, {"text": "I'm sticking with my lucky club.", "start": 811.578, "duration": 1.468}, {"text": "This is your chance.", "start": 813.113, "duration": 1.101}, {"text": "[Grant] My goodness.", "start": 816.45, "duration": 1.501}, {"text": "Yikes!", "start": 818.151, "duration": 1.168}, {"text": "Lock in. Alright?", "start": 819.453, "duration": 1.334}, {"text": "Let's go.", "start": 821.255, "duration": 1.001}, {"text": "Oh, no! Chandler! Chandler!", "start": 822.322, "duration": 2.303}, {"text": "[Robo-T] Ka-boom.", "start": 825.559, "duration": 0.968}, {"text": "We're down now.", "start": 827.895, "duration": 1.067}, {"text": "Alright, now we're going pretty far\nto one…", "start": 829.029, "duration": 1.768}, {"text": "175 yards.", "start": 830.864, "duration": 0.934}, {"text": "-175 yards…\n-The wind’s pumping.", "start": 831.865, "duration": 1.568}, {"text": "Grant, have you considered\nhitting the target?", "start": 833.5, "duration": 2.302}, {"text": "You have to tie it up here.", "start": 836.069, "duration": 1.068}, {"text": "[Grant] No! Right.", "start": 839.439, "duration": 1.669}, {"text": "Well, I hope you packed your bags.", "start": 841.308, "duration": 1.401}, {"text": "This is the most nervous I've been so far.", "start": 842.776, "duration": 1.969}, {"text": "Oh my gosh.", "start": 847.781, "duration": 1.135}, {"text": "-[Grant] No! No!\n-[Chandler] Please, please.", "start": 849.149, "duration": 1.869}, {"text": "Oh! You hear that?\nThat's it!", "start": 853.353, "duration": 2.903}, {"text": "Oh, Grant.", "start": 856.59, "duration": 1.301}, {"text": "Alright. Another win for Team Robot. G", "start": 857.958, "duration": 2.236}, {"text": "rant, anything to say?", "start": 860.26, "duration": 1.201}, {"text": "This one's going to sting for a while.", "start": 861.762, "duration": 1.568}, {"text": "It's all tied up, and we are heading\nto our final showdown.", "start": 863.564, "duration": 4.104}, {"text": "Meaning everything all comes down to this.", "start": 867.734, "duration": 3.07}, {"text": "Will us humans prove to the world\nthat we are not replaceable?", "start": 870.871, "duration": 4.571}, {"text": "Or will robots turn the page of history\nand mark the fate of our future?", "start": 875.509, "duration": 5.605}, {"text": "Only one can win the battle.", "start": 881.181, "duration": 2.302}, {"text": "The new age question:\nMan or machine?", "start": 883.55, "duration": 3.237}, {"text": "Now, the moment\nyou’ve all been waiting for!", "start": 887.187, "duration": 2.036}, {"text": "Noah Lyles,\nthe fastest man in the world", "start": 889.289, "duration": 2.236}, {"text": "vs. not just 1, but 3 robots,", "start": 891.592, "duration": 3.37}, {"text": "each increasing in speed.", "start": 895.028, "duration": 1.669}, {"text": "They will run a simple 50 meter dash.", "start": 896.93, "duration": 2.703}, {"text": "If Noah somehow manages to win\nagainst all 3 robots,", "start": 899.7, "duration": 3.77}, {"text": "he will score the tie breaking point\nfor humanity.", "start": 903.537, "duration": 2.703}, {"text": "But if even one beats him in a race,", "start": 906.54, "duration": 2.302}, {"text": "the robots get a point,\nand us humans are obsolete.", "start": 908.909, "duration": 3.303}, {"text": "Up first is the Unitree G1,", "start": 912.279, "duration": 2.202}, {"text": "a robot so athletic it can balance,\nflip, and even fight.", "start": 914.548, "duration": 4.905}, {"text": "Let's roll.", "start": 920.02, "duration": 0.501}, {"text": "Let's get it.", "start": 920.587, "duration": 0.734}, {"text": "Alright, you want me\nto hold your medals for you?", "start": 921.388, "duration": 1.435}, {"text": "-Thank you, sir.\n-Yeah. Let me…", "start": 922.89, "duration": 1.401}, {"text": "Might be a little heavier than you think.\nBe careful.", "start": 924.358, "duration": 1.568}, {"text": "Oh! Oh my God.\nAre these actual gold? [laughing]", "start": 925.993, "duration": 2.802}, {"text": "Alright, race #1.", "start": 930.33, "duration": 1.735}, {"text": "Let's see if Noah can win all 3.", "start": 932.132, "duration": 3.17}, {"text": "Ready! Set!", "start": 935.369, "duration": 1.735}, {"text": "Go! Go, robot!\nRun! Go! Run!", "start": 939.406, "duration": 3.27}, {"text": "[Tareq] Dude, that's not even close.", "start": 943.11, "duration": 1.334}, {"text": "I could beat this robot,\nand I'm slow as heck.", "start": 944.511, "duration": 2.369}, {"text": "But these next two robots Noah’s\nabout to race are way faster.", "start": 946.947, "duration": 3.604}, {"text": "The robot's still running! [laughing]", "start": 950.617, "duration": 1.769}, {"text": "Bro!", "start": 952.819, "duration": 0.434}, {"text": "Go! Go!", "start": 953.253, "duration": 1.201}, {"text": "-[Jimmy] Ok.\n-[Tareq] Let's go!", "start": 954.521, "duration": 0.968}, {"text": "Better luck next time, humanity.", "start": 955.556, "duration": 1.935}, {"text": "Ha-ha-ha-ho-oh!", "start": 957.558, "duration": 1.468}, {"text": "But you lost.", "start": 959.092, "duration": 0.901}, {"text": "Better luck next time. Oh!", "start": 960.06, "duration": 1.768}, {"text": "Oh! It’s dancing on you.", "start": 961.895, "duration": 1.001}, {"text": "No, I ain't gon’ take this!", "start": 962.963, "duration": 1.068}, {"text": "Up next is a genuine racing competitor,\nthe Unitree H1.", "start": 966.066, "duration": 4.238}, {"text": "It won multiple medals\nat the 2025 World Humanoid Robot Games,", "start": 970.37, "duration": 4.839}, {"text": "making it the fastest robot\non two legs.", "start": 975.275, "duration": 3.037}, {"text": "What's it like looking over there\nand not seeing another sprinter?", "start": 978.412, "duration": 2.636}, {"text": "I mean, isn't that how all my races go?", "start": 981.114, "duration": 1.936}, {"text": "[laughing] Oh my gosh!", "start": 983.35, "duration": 1.301}, {"text": "Alright, race #2.\nIt could all end here.", "start": 984.852, "duration": 3.436}, {"text": "H1, are you ready?", "start": 988.488, "duration": 1.369}, {"text": "Noah, are you ready?", "start": 991.258, "duration": 1.234}, {"text": "Let's go!", "start": 992.559, "duration": 0.968}, {"text": "Set!", "start": 993.594, "duration": 0.734}, {"text": "Go! Robot, go! H1!", "start": 997.631, "duration": 2.035}, {"text": "Go! Run! Oh my goodness!", "start": 999.733, "duration": 2.369}, {"text": "He's blowing the robot\nout of the water!", "start": 1002.603, "duration": 1.668}, {"text": "Oh, it's not even close.", "start": 1004.338, "duration": 1.234}, {"text": "He already beat you.", "start": 1006.807, "duration": 0.767}, {"text": "He already beat you.\nI'm sorry, man.", "start": 1007.641, "duration": 1.869}, {"text": "Good form, though.", "start": 1010.277, "duration": 0.834}, {"text": "I had a feeling you would destroy H1.", "start": 1011.278, "duration": 1.868}, {"text": "Uh, yeah.", "start": 1013.213, "duration": 0.768}, {"text": "Which is why we brought some\nnon-humanoid robots.", "start": 1014.047, "duration": 2.903}, {"text": "Let's go to Phase 3.", "start": 1018.318, "duration": 1.101}, {"text": "This is Black Panther.", "start": 1020.988, "duration": 2.068}, {"text": "Modeled after the cheetah,", "start": 1023.824, "duration": 1.802}, {"text": "it can reach speeds\nover 22 miles per hour.", "start": 1025.692, "duration": 3.437}, {"text": "This is just the fastest robot, period", "start": 1029.296, "duration": 2.336}, {"text": "What am I racing, dogs now?", "start": 1031.698, "duration": 1.235}, {"text": "Are you ready to face\nthe peak of robotic athleticism?", "start": 1033.166, "duration": 4.405}, {"text": "Let's go!", "start": 1037.638, "duration": 0.901}, {"text": "Humanity is resting in Noah Lyles' legs.", "start": 1038.605, "duration": 3.003}, {"text": "[grunts]", "start": 1042.009, "duration": 0.6}, {"text": "All the competitors and all their efforts…", "start": 1042.676, "duration": 3.37}, {"text": "Yeah!", "start": 1046.113, "duration": 0.667}, {"text": "All their successes…", "start": 1046.847, "duration": 1.068}, {"text": "Oh!", "start": 1051.351, "duration": 0.734}, {"text": "…and disappointments come down\nto this final race.", "start": 1052.152, "duration": 4.605}, {"text": "For humanity!", "start": 1056.823, "duration": 0.801}, {"text": "Let's go!", "start": 1057.691, "duration": 1.101}, {"text": "Ready?", "start": 1060.661, "duration": 0.734}, {"text": "Set…", "start": 1062.629, "duration": 0.734}, {"text": "He’s off!", "start": 1071.939, "duration": 0.6}, {"text": "Oh, the robot's fast!", "start": 1072.606, "duration": 1.268}, {"text": "Go, Black Panther! Go!", "start": 1073.941, "duration": 1.868}, {"text": "It's right behind you!", "start": 1075.876, "duration": 0.968}, {"text": "Oh, oh, it's catchin’ up!", "start": 1076.91, "duration": 1.201}, {"text": "Noah might lose.", "start": 1078.178, "duration": 1.001}, {"text": "Whoa! Hey, lowkey,\nthat robot was a little scary.", "start": 1082.916, "duration": 2.703}, {"text": "Humanity wins!", "start": 1085.686, "duration": 1.401}, {"text": "One day, robots will overtake us.", "start": 1087.154, "duration": 1.735}, {"text": "But in 2025, humans still have an edge.", "start": 1088.956, "duration": 4.004}, {"text": "Humanity is saved once again.", "start": 1093.26, "duration": 1.802}, {"text": "Robots are not better than us.", "start": 1095.128, "duration": 1.969}, {"text": "At least not yet…", "start": 1097.164, "duration": 0.801}]}